# Media: No box-shadow by default

- Do **not** add `box-shadow` to `img`, `video`, or their wrapper elements (e.g. `.gallery-item`, `.case-image`, `.overview-video-wrap`, `.project-image-link`) unless the user explicitly requests it.
- This applies to the entire site.
